---@return posthog.task_channels.ProvisionedChannels? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:create_task_channels_provision_default(input) end

---Set a space up for a goal or a feature
---
---Starts one unattended task in the channel that resolves the metric, writes the context page and, for a goal, creates the tracking canvas and the loops. The task becomes the channel's context generation task.
---
---`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/task_channels/{id}/setup/`
---Errors: Conflict.
---@param input posthog.task_channels.CreateTaskChannelsSetupRequest
---@return posthog.task_channels.SpaceSetupStartedDTO? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:create_task_channels_setup(input) end

