---List who worked in each channel
---
---For each channel the requester can access, list the people who own at least one task or canvas in it, most recently active first. Channels with no owners are left out.
---
---`GET /api/projects/{project_id}/task_channels/contributors/`
---@param input posthog.task_channels.GetTaskChannelsContributorRequest
---@return posthog.task_channels.GetTaskChannelsContributorResponseBodyList? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_task_channels_contributor(input) end

---Get channel instructions
---
---The channel's latest CONTEXT.md instructions. A channel with no published instructions reads as a blank version 0 — publish against base_version 0 to create version 1.
---
---`GET /api/projects/{project_id}/task_channels/{id}/instructions/`
---@param input posthog.task_channels.GetTaskChannelsInstructionRequest
---@return posthog.task_channels.ChannelInstructionsDTO? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_task_channels_instruction(input) end

---List channel instruction versions
---
---`GET /api/projects/{project_id}/task_channels/{id}/instructions/versions/`
---@param input posthog.task_channels.GetTaskChannelsInstructionsVersionRequest
---@return posthog.task_channels.PaginatedChannelInstructionsDTOList? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_task_channels_instructions_version(input) end

---List a channel's members
---
---List the members of a private channel. Return an empty list for public and personal channels. Return 404 if the requester cannot access the channel.
---
---`GET /api/projects/{project_id}/task_channels/{id}/members/`
---@param input posthog.task_channels.GetTaskChannelsMemberRequest
---@return posthog.task_channels.GetTaskChannelsMemberResponseBodyList? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_task_channels_member(input) end

---List channels
---
---List channels the requester can access, sorted by name and ID. Includes public channels, their personal #me channel, and private channels they belong to. Call provision_defaults to create missing default channels. Send limit and offset to get a page with count, next, previous, and results. Without limit, the response is an array of all accessible channels.
---
---`GET /api/projects/{project_id}/task_channels/`
---@param input posthog.task_channels.ListTaskChannelsRequest
---@return posthog.task_channels.ChannelListResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:list_task_channels(input) end

